; Regression test for issue #3313: the directive-line commodity parser,
; reworked for #3313 to leave its cursor at a comment, used to step two
; characters past a quoted symbol's closing quote, assuming a space.
; Without the space, `P 2024/01/01 "N1"1.50 EUR` lost the first digit of
; its price and recorded 0.50 EUR.

P 2024/01/01 "N1"1.50 EUR
P 2024/01/01 "N2" 2.50 EUR

2024/01/02 Test
    Assets:Cash    10 "N1"
    Assets:Cash    10 "N2"
    Assets:Cash    1.00 EUR
    Equity

test prices
2024/01/01 "N1"         1.50 EUR
2024/01/01 "N2"         2.50 EUR
end test

test bal --flat -X EUR Assets
           41.00 EUR  Assets:Cash
end test
